  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "From the roaring crowds of E3 in Los Angeles, to the electric atmosphere of Gamescom, and the intensity of ESL tournaments, LoL Worlds, and beyond — every event tells its own story. Each light, sound, and cheer becomes part of a living world — one built on passion, competition, and connection.",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\">From the roaring crowds of <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">E3</span></span> in Los Angeles, to the electric atmosphere of <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Gamescom</span>,</span> and the intensity of <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">ESL tournaments, LoL Worlds, and beyond</span></span> — every event tells its own story. Each light, sound, and cheer becomes part of a living world — one built on passion, competition, and connection.</h2>"
    },
